<br><b>&lt;Mobius&gt;</b> You can do that...
<br><b>&lt;Mobius&gt;</b> Also, armors may be constructed out of number different materials..
<br><b>&lt;Mobius&gt;</b> Armor made from true silver is going to look different from armor made from verite..
<br><b>&lt;Mobius&gt;</b> The artists have been toying around with even more possibility for customization, but...
<br><b>&lt;Mobius&gt;</b> we'll talk about those if they come on line.
<p><b>&lt;Joshua_Rowan&gt;</b>  *Egroups* Fiction. The Fiction is amazing! Can we expect to see more Prequel Fiction soon? 
