<p><b>&lt;Joshua_Rowan&gt;</b> *DSC_FLY* As far as a test server is concerned (used to test patches before you come out... and that kinda stuff ya know:) what will be the status on there? will it be like a normal shard with the newest stuff? or will it be like the late great test server of EQ where you will wipe players and items?
