<p><b>&lt;Joshua_Rowan&gt;</b>  *Bizzmark* Concerning the UO World Faire and promised Origin external beta testing opporotunities to attendees.. how much longer will those of us that really can't make it have to wait to get into the test, and how many of those applicants will be accepted?
<br><b>&lt;Ubiq&gt;</b> Part of testing is being sure that the community features and economic balance plays right.
