<br><b>&lt;Ubiq&gt;</b> Because fundamentally, the test server is there to test the integrity of the game.
<p><b>&lt;Joshua_Rowan&gt;</b> *Kypher_East* Will we see a larger diversity of items in UO2 than UO? As well as individual artwork for each item? How about unique/named/dyed special items for players?
