<p><b>&lt;Joshua_Rowan&gt;</b> *Talebearer* Does the dev team see any way to create an NPC-free world controlled soley by the players?
<br><b>&lt;Shadowlord_&gt;</b> I just sneak in with my two cents....
<br><b>&lt;Ubiq&gt;</b> Short version: not if you want it to be mass market.  Longer version: not for our particular game design.
<br><b>&lt;Ubiq&gt;</b> NPCs do some things that are very useful.  The most important thing is that they act as a safety net
<br><b>&lt;Ubiq&gt;</b> for new players coming into the game.  It's very important that newbies know there is a reliable place
<br><b>&lt;Ubiq&gt;</b> to sell and buy goods at a reasonable price.
<br>* Windfeather mutters something about the original System Shock.
<br><b>&lt;Ubiq&gt;</b> In our system, NPCs are more important because we are focusing so much on story
<br><b>&lt;Ubiq&gt;</b> So NPCs become useful for story information, for quests, and of course, for teaching the skills in our skill tree, which are, as we all now know, really cool.
<br><b>&lt;Windfeather&gt;</b> Our NPCs are indeed much more useful than in any game I've seen previously.
<br><b>&lt;Mobius&gt;</b> You keep saying that. :)
<br><b>&lt;Ubiq&gt;</b> Can a MMPRPG game succeed without NPCs?  Sure, if designed just right.  After all, player to player interaction is the most important thing
<br><b>&lt;Ubiq&gt;</b> And we have gone to great lengths to ensure that our NPCs don't ever make players obsolete (that whole Adventurer's economy thing)
<br><b>&lt;Ubiq&gt;</b> But an NPC-less world is not a route we decided to take.
<p><b>&lt;Joshua_Rowan&gt;</b> *MystiqueDeKami* Will mages be able to cast healing spells or is that researved for the healing skill only? And if so could you hint a little to which schools of magic would contain these spells (ie. fire/water/ether/etc)
<br><b>&lt;Mobius&gt;</b> Yes, there are healing spells...
<br><b>&lt;Mobius&gt;</b> If I had to choose one school that had the most healing spells, I'd say Water.
<br><b>&lt;Ubiq&gt;</b> Water is indeed the school o fhealing.
<p><b>&lt;Joshua_Rowan&gt;</b> *Ghosty* Will Origin be offereing some of the more rare martial arts techniques such as Tai Chi? It would be awesome to do some of the stuff they can do.
